WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.060 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 10]

01:41.670 --> 01:42.460
How did scum like him

01:42.710 --> 01:43.770
end up in Yellow Maple Valley?

01:44.270 --> 01:45.330
And yet the Foundation Pill

01:45.640 --> 01:46.730
has fallen into his hands.

01:47.240 --> 01:48.410
He deserves to die.

01:49.320 --> 01:49.980
But his cultivation

01:50.240 --> 01:51.490
is higher than mine.

01:52.000 --> 01:52.850
I doubt I stand a chance against him.

01:53.600 --> 01:54.300
This is

01:54.440 --> 01:55.170
a Joyful Union Pill,

01:55.350 --> 01:57.490
refined with lust poison extracted from a Level 2 demon beast.

02:03.000 --> 02:03.740
Here.

02:09.240 --> 02:10.900
I'm curious to see

02:11.240 --> 02:11.860
what becomes of you

02:11.960 --> 02:13.330
after swallowing this.

02:18.520 --> 02:19.410
Hey,

02:20.000 --> 02:21.130
you've been lurking long enough.

02:21.840 --> 02:22.980
Time to show yourself.

02:31.920 --> 02:33.260
It's you.

02:34.030 --> 02:35.770
I've been waiting for the chance to eliminate you.

02:36.200 --> 02:37.580
And now, you come straight to me.

02:38.000 --> 02:38.730
I'll have to fight him.

02:45.560 --> 02:47.050
Turns out you're not just a thief,

02:47.480 --> 02:48.770
but a pervert as well.

03:02.710 --> 03:03.260
Come!

04:46.520 --> 04:47.260
Wind Barrier!

05:00.360 --> 05:01.130
It's useless.

05:01.630 --> 05:03.380
This banner is powered by a mid-grade gem.

05:03.520 --> 05:04.730
Its spiritual power never runs out.

05:05.240 --> 05:06.980
Your artifact isn't fully refined.

05:07.150 --> 05:08.980
It's no better than an ordinary weapon.

05:09.150 --> 05:10.260
Still want to fight me?

05:16.240 --> 05:16.980
Swift Travel Talisman!

05:29.360 --> 05:31.340
No wonder it costs 50 gems a sheet.

05:31.800 --> 05:33.260
The speed boost is incredible.

05:34.310 --> 05:35.130
Thanks for the tip.

05:36.560 --> 05:38.220
So all I have to do is wield it like a normal weapon.

05:56.120 --> 05:57.290
Wait, this is mine.

05:57.680 --> 05:58.850
Even the box is the same.

05:59.240 --> 06:00.660
So Ye sold it to him.

06:01.480 --> 06:02.140
The Foundation Pill

06:03.630 --> 06:04.980
has finally been returned to its rightful owner.

06:07.560 --> 06:08.410
I'll take this one

06:10.680 --> 06:11.780
as compensation.

06:46.310 --> 06:47.020
Senior Chen.

06:55.560 --> 06:55.930
Senior,

06:56.240 --> 06:56.980
please behave yourself!

06:59.720 --> 07:00.370
Your clothes...

07:00.480 --> 07:01.250
Your clothes are loose!

07:02.000 --> 07:02.850
Your clothes are loose!

07:04.120 --> 07:05.020
Please compose yourself!

07:05.190 --> 07:05.540
Now!

07:09.720 --> 07:10.810
That scoundrel drugged you.

07:11.120 --> 07:11.580
Come back

07:11.800 --> 07:12.340
to your senses!

07:16.800 --> 07:17.250
Senior!

07:42.750 --> 07:44.220
Even if I stepped in to do the right thing,

07:44.950 --> 07:45.930
killing a fellow disciple

07:46.360 --> 07:47.370
is still a serious offense.

07:48.360 --> 07:50.140
I'm not the kind of person who'd silence someone through murder.

07:51.830 --> 07:52.700
So, Senior Chen,

07:53.600 --> 07:54.850
you'll have to take an Oblivion Pill.

07:56.070 --> 07:57.050
Once you swallow it,

07:58.000 --> 07:59.140
you'll forget everything

07:59.830 --> 08:01.290
that happened today,

08:02.920 --> 08:03.850
including my presence.

08:47.560 --> 08:48.220
Nichang,

08:49.040 --> 08:50.140
any news about Ruyan?

08:53.430 --> 08:54.490
I heard from the Yan clan

08:54.630 --> 08:55.810
that she still hasn't woken up.

08:56.310 --> 08:57.140
But they're looking

08:57.240 --> 08:59.170
for the Blood Spirit Flower in the Bloody Trial Ground.

08:59.750 --> 09:00.580
If they find it,

09:01.240 --> 09:02.170
she might still have a chance.

09:04.430 --> 09:05.460
The Trial Ground is dangerous,

09:05.830 --> 09:06.900
and we also have sect duties.

09:07.510 --> 09:09.140
We can't have our disciples make a detour

09:09.750 --> 09:10.930
just for that flower.

09:12.070 --> 09:12.660
Indeed.

09:13.070 --> 09:14.340
With Ruyan's talent,

09:15.680 --> 09:17.540
she should've been the one leading the trial team.

09:19.190 --> 09:20.170
But now that she has fallen ill,

09:21.040 --> 09:21.930
everything is out of order.

09:24.830 --> 09:25.410
Nichang,

09:25.720 --> 09:26.810
I might have a solution.

09:32.310 --> 09:33.100
Absolutely not.

09:34.040 --> 09:35.100
The Seven Sects have clearly stated that only

09:35.390 --> 09:36.290
Qi Refining Stage disciples

09:36.310 --> 09:37.700
may enter the Bloody Trial Ground.

09:38.950 --> 09:39.810
Breaking that rule...

09:41.120 --> 09:42.140
Have you forgotten?

09:42.600 --> 09:44.020
My Maiden Cycle Art allows me

09:44.360 --> 09:45.540
to suppress my cultivation.

09:45.920 --> 09:46.900
If I lower it to the Qi Refining Stage,

09:47.000 --> 09:48.100
then I'm technically

09:48.310 --> 09:49.540
still a Qi Refining Stage disciple.

09:50.070 --> 09:51.340
No one can say otherwise.

09:52.120 --> 09:53.660
Are you seriously risking everything

09:54.270 --> 09:55.610
for a single Blood Spirit Flower?

09:56.310 --> 09:57.410
You'd cripple your cultivation down to the Qi Refining stage?

09:58.720 --> 09:59.730
You must be mad.

10:00.390 --> 10:02.250
Even if you're willing, I'd never stand for it.

10:03.270 --> 10:04.170
Ruyan is the Yan clan's only heir.

10:04.430 --> 10:05.900
Ever since what happened to her at Moonshadow Sect,

10:06.310 --> 10:07.700
we owe her everything.

10:08.550 --> 10:09.250
Besides,

10:09.750 --> 10:10.890
I'm rather fond of her.

10:12.000 --> 10:12.530
And

10:12.910 --> 10:13.490
the Yan Clan Stronghold

10:13.600 --> 10:14.850
has defended the border of Yue Kingdom

10:15.240 --> 10:17.010
for nearly a hundred years, holding off the demonic sects

10:17.440 --> 10:18.300
for the Seven Sects.

10:18.960 --> 10:19.610
I'm certain

10:19.720 --> 10:20.730
I can retrieve the Blood Spirit Flower

10:21.000 --> 10:22.610
and save Yan Ruyan's life

10:22.840 --> 10:23.820
if I enter the grounds.

10:24.270 --> 10:25.650
The item we seek

10:25.720 --> 10:26.370
is of utmost importance.

10:26.670 --> 10:27.300
Only I can ensure

10:27.320 --> 10:28.580
it's brought back safely.

10:29.150 --> 10:30.730
Besides, my cultivation will recover soon enough.

10:31.240 --> 10:31.850
It's decided.

10:33.360 --> 10:34.580
This secret must be kept at all costs.

10:39.380 --> 10:41.620
[Somewhere in Spirit Beast Mountain]

10:51.790 --> 10:52.370
Young Master.

10:53.870 --> 10:55.060
Your Blood Spirit Spell

10:55.080 --> 10:56.060
has improved a lot.

10:58.200 --> 10:58.980
I told you to look into the list

10:59.000 --> 11:01.220
of those heading to the Bloody Trial Ground from Spirit Beast Mountain.

11:02.480 --> 11:03.010
Where's the list?

11:04.790 --> 11:06.490
Many have signed up,

11:07.200 --> 11:08.650
but we're supposed to be selecting

11:08.960 --> 11:09.820
only the obedient ones, right?

11:11.630 --> 11:13.010
Are we choosing based on obedience,

11:13.750 --> 11:14.890
or the quality of their gifts?

11:16.080 --> 11:17.220
[Zhong Wu, Spirit Beast Mountain]
Young Master, what are you implying?

11:18.480 --> 11:19.650
Take Yan Lei for example.

11:20.000 --> 11:21.100
He's come seven or eight times.

11:21.960 --> 11:23.530
I only accepted his gift the very first time.

11:24.270 --> 11:25.700
I thought you might appreciate it.

11:27.030 --> 11:27.850
But rest assured.

11:28.480 --> 11:29.420
Even if we had taken his offerings,

11:29.720 --> 11:30.940
he still wouldn't be allowed in.

11:31.120 --> 11:32.420
After all, he's from the Yan Clan Stronghold.

11:35.960 --> 11:36.490
The Yan Clan Stronghold?

11:37.900 --> 11:42.060
[Yan Clan Stronghold, Yue Kingdom]

11:46.750 --> 11:47.300
My Lord,

11:47.960 --> 11:50.220
the disciples from each sect attending the Bloody Trial

11:50.240 --> 11:51.180
have already been decided.

11:51.180 --> 11:51.910
[Yan Yunshan, Lord of the Yan Clan Stronghold]

11:51.910 --> 11:53.700
Even if ours send gifts,

11:53.720 --> 11:55.060
it might not change anything.

11:56.030 --> 11:57.300
But the Moonshadow Sect said

11:57.300 --> 11:58.700
[Elder Liu, Yan Clan Stronghold]

11:58.750 --> 12:00.100
they would help us

12:00.120 --> 12:01.820
get the Blood Spirit Flower.

12:02.120 --> 12:03.300
They told us to wait for good news.

12:04.200 --> 12:06.060
This happened under their watch.

12:07.240 --> 12:08.610
Of course, they should help.

12:10.360 --> 12:11.490
That may be true,

12:11.790 --> 12:12.610
but...

12:13.270 --> 12:14.730
But everything in this world

12:15.720 --> 12:17.100
is a matter of exchange.

12:19.270 --> 12:19.700
Elder Liu,

12:20.790 --> 12:22.250
make another trip to Moonshadow Sect

12:22.390 --> 12:23.100
and give this letter

12:23.440 --> 12:24.300
to their sect leader.

12:24.670 --> 12:25.850
As long as they give their all

12:26.240 --> 12:27.730
to find the Blood Spirit Flower and save Yan,

12:28.870 --> 12:29.820
the Yan Clan Stronghold's quarry

12:30.480 --> 12:31.250
will be theirs.

12:32.550 --> 12:33.010
My Lord,

12:33.360 --> 12:34.300
you mustn't do this!

12:35.030 --> 12:37.530
The quarry's profits are the lifeblood of the Yan Clan Stronghold.

12:37.790 --> 12:39.770
How can we hand it over just like that?

12:40.870 --> 12:42.130
She is my only daughter.

12:43.120 --> 12:44.530
I would give my life to save her.

12:45.510 --> 12:47.100
What is a gem business compared to that?

12:52.670 --> 12:53.220
Who's there?

13:05.320 --> 13:06.580
Core Formation cultivators.

13:11.440 --> 13:12.650
But all of them are Early Core Stage.

13:18.200 --> 13:19.220
And yet a Mid Foundation Establishment Stage cultivator

13:19.440 --> 13:21.060
can command them.

13:21.960 --> 13:23.940
It's just a trip to the Bloody Trial Ground.

13:24.510 --> 13:26.100
Lord Yan, is this really necessary?

13:29.360 --> 13:30.060
Who are you?

13:30.720 --> 13:31.220
I am

13:31.630 --> 13:32.490
Wang Chan, the Young Master

13:32.840 --> 13:33.420
of the Ghost Spirit Sect.

13:39.480 --> 13:41.060
You're Wang Tiangu's son?

13:41.630 --> 13:42.100
That's me.

13:42.750 --> 13:43.370
Word is you're desperate

13:43.510 --> 13:45.770
to your disciples

13:45.910 --> 13:48.300
into the Bloody Trial.

13:48.670 --> 13:49.340
I assume

13:49.630 --> 13:52.010
you're after something important.

13:53.840 --> 13:54.850
Since the Seven Sects

13:55.000 --> 13:56.610
are unwilling to help,

13:57.360 --> 13:59.460
why not turn to the Six Sects?

14:07.510 --> 14:09.650
The Seven Sects always claim to walk the righteous path,

14:10.360 --> 14:12.460
yet they monopolize the Bloody Trial Ground.

14:13.000 --> 14:14.220
Asking them for help is harder

14:14.790 --> 14:15.940
than climbing to the heavens.

14:19.240 --> 14:21.060
You are the Lord of the Yan Clan Stronghold.

14:21.670 --> 14:22.220
Isn't this

14:23.000 --> 14:23.650
far too humiliating

14:24.840 --> 14:26.130
for someone of your stature?

14:37.550 --> 14:38.700
What are you trying to say?

14:39.910 --> 14:40.890
I can arrange for someone

14:41.240 --> 14:42.060
to enter the Bloody Trial Ground

14:42.270 --> 14:43.610
and retrieve what you are after.

14:44.200 --> 14:45.010
No matter what it is,

14:46.480 --> 14:47.700
I can help you.

14:54.910 --> 14:56.180
Have you forgotten

14:56.670 --> 14:57.370
that centuries ago,

14:57.670 --> 14:58.490
the Yan Clan Stronghold and Ghost Spirit Sect

14:58.670 --> 15:00.730
were one and the same?

15:01.840 --> 15:03.180
You should go back.

15:07.630 --> 15:08.890
You should also remember,

15:10.150 --> 15:11.530
only those who are willing to help you

15:12.030 --> 15:13.060
are truly your friends.

15:13.910 --> 15:14.460
Enough.

15:14.910 --> 15:15.460
Leave.

15:36.000 --> 15:36.890
How's the investigation going?

15:37.440 --> 15:38.180
Yan Yunshan is desperately

15:38.240 --> 15:39.770
dispatching people to the Bloody Trial Ground

15:40.030 --> 15:41.100
not for a Foundation Pill,

15:41.600 --> 15:42.340
but for

15:42.670 --> 15:43.730
his ailing daughter.

15:44.720 --> 15:45.340
Her daughter?

15:46.510 --> 15:47.100
Her name

15:47.440 --> 15:48.370
is Yan Ruyan.

15:48.720 --> 15:49.300
She was born

15:49.320 --> 15:50.730
with a heavenly spirit root,

15:50.960 --> 15:51.730
something that only appears once in centuries.

15:53.390 --> 15:54.130
A heavenly spirit root?

15:54.550 --> 15:55.130
That explains

15:55.550 --> 15:56.220
why the Yan Clan Stronghold will stop at nothing

15:56.360 --> 15:57.100
to protect her.

15:57.840 --> 15:58.460
However,

15:58.910 --> 15:59.430
her old illness

15:59.480 --> 16:00.420
has returned,

16:00.550 --> 16:01.460
and she teeters on the brink of death.

16:02.000 --> 16:03.060
The only thing that can save her

16:03.080 --> 16:04.490
is the Blood Spirit Flower, which only grows inside the Trial Ground.

16:05.030 --> 16:05.770
That explains things.

16:08.910 --> 16:09.890
I see.

16:10.600 --> 16:11.490
So if we control

16:12.270 --> 16:13.940
the Blood Spirit Flower,

16:14.720 --> 16:15.890
we can control the Yan Clan Stronghold.

16:16.670 --> 16:17.850
And if we control the Yan Clan Stronghold,

16:18.480 --> 16:20.490
we gain the upper hand in the coming war.

16:23.600 --> 16:24.580
Interesting.

16:25.870 --> 16:27.850
Looks like Zhong Wu has work to do again.

16:33.840 --> 16:34.890
The heavenly spirit root,

16:39.720 --> 16:41.370
I've finally found you.

16:45.940 --> 16:49.180
[Day of Departure for the Trial]

17:01.120 --> 17:02.940
She won't remember what happened that day, right?

17:11.630 --> 17:12.460
The weather is good today.

17:14.270 --> 17:15.100
You can even see the snowy peaks.

17:17.480 --> 17:18.460
The Grandmaster is here.

17:23.840 --> 17:24.820
Grandmaster.

17:32.910 --> 17:33.770
Take a good look.

17:34.390 --> 17:35.850
This is the Soul-Burning Spell.

17:36.320 --> 17:37.180
Each of you will be randomly

17:37.440 --> 17:39.220
teleported to a location

17:39.630 --> 17:40.700
inside the Trial Ground.

17:42.510 --> 17:43.730
Where you land depends

17:44.790 --> 17:45.940
entirely on luck.

17:46.360 --> 17:48.530
What we can do as a sect is plant

17:49.120 --> 17:51.220
our Soul-Burning Spell on your bodies.

17:51.960 --> 17:53.340
Within a certain range,

17:53.790 --> 17:56.010
you'll be able to sense the location of your fellow disciples.

17:57.720 --> 17:58.490
Every sect

17:58.750 --> 17:59.770
is secretly competing

17:59.840 --> 18:00.730
in this trial.

18:01.910 --> 18:03.220
The number of spirit herbs collected

18:03.480 --> 18:04.460
will affect

18:04.480 --> 18:06.490
our sect's standing for the next 60 years.

18:07.150 --> 18:09.490
The Moonshadow Sect is abusing their influence

18:09.720 --> 18:11.580
and altering the Trial Ground's seal times as they like.

18:12.150 --> 18:12.820
We must not

18:12.840 --> 18:14.420
let them walk all over us.

18:16.320 --> 18:17.180
We'll show them

18:17.440 --> 18:17.940
who

18:18.630 --> 18:20.370
the true force among the Seven Sects is!

18:29.320 --> 18:29.890
Got it!

18:31.120 --> 18:32.450
- Un... Understood. - Got it!

18:32.480 --> 18:33.180
Got it.

18:35.510 --> 18:36.180
Move out!

19:04.460 --> 19:05.380
♪Chasing wind♪

19:05.700 --> 19:07.780
♪I set out afar♪

19:08.140 --> 19:09.540
♪The road ahead lost♪

19:10.060 --> 19:11.220
♪My voice unheard♪

19:11.820 --> 19:13.300
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

19:13.580 --> 19:14.380
♪Laying low♪

19:15.020 --> 19:16.500
♪I plan every move♪

19:16.980 --> 19:18.500
♪With a mortal heart

19:18.940 --> 19:20.220
♪And lingering ties♪

19:20.860 --> 19:22.020
♪I'm roaming far and wide...♪

19:22.030 --> 19:23.810
You've gained weight.

19:26.540 --> 19:29.540
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

19:33.590 --> 19:34.220
Move out!

19:34.270 --> 19:35.460
Let's go!

19:35.460 --> 19:39.700
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

19:43.340 --> 19:45.020
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

19:45.790 --> 19:46.420
Off we go!

19:47.260 --> 19:48.940
♪As chaos shakes the world♪

19:52.220 --> 19:54.020
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

19:54.500 --> 19:55.700
♪Kind at heart♪

19:56.140 --> 19:57.540
♪Ruthless when I must be♪

19:57.940 --> 19:59.660
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

19:59.980 --> 20:01.820
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

20:02.220 --> 20:04.140
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

20:04.420 --> 20:06.260
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

20:10.220 --> 20:11.660
♪Forged by trial♪

20:12.020 --> 20:13.860
♪I rise through three realms♪

20:14.420 --> 20:17.620
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

20:20.980 --> 20:24.380
♪Drunken steps, high song over ocean and mountaintop♪

20:25.420 --> 20:28.860
♪The celestial gourd bears dew, the Golden Core takes shape♪

20:29.580 --> 20:33.500
♪Deep in the night, the crane soars through autumn's clear sky♪

20:34.380 --> 20:36.460
♪Across endless western winds cuts a lone sword, cold and true♪

20:37.380 --> 20:40.740
♪A lone sword, cold and true♪

20:57.740 --> 21:00.420
[Zhong Shu, Spirit Beast Mountain]

21:10.440 --> 21:11.090
Steady now!

21:12.160 --> 21:13.380
We're almost there.

21:32.590 --> 21:33.050
Everyone,

21:33.590 --> 21:34.380
the Young Master has ordered

21:34.640 --> 21:36.770
that we are not to let the Yan Clan Stronghold obtain the Blood Spirit Flower.

21:37.880 --> 21:39.290
If you encounter elite disciples of the Seven Sects,

21:39.680 --> 21:40.660
do everything to kill

21:40.830 --> 21:41.330
or injure them.

21:41.640 --> 21:42.620
Don't reveal your identity.

21:44.030 --> 21:44.700
That's a given.

22:17.680 --> 22:18.980
This is the Bloody Trial Ground.

22:20.400 --> 22:21.220
It's so quiet.

22:23.340 --> 22:26.540
[Feng Yue, Skyfort Castle]

23:10.980 --> 23:12.340
[Bloody Trial Ground Entrance]

23:13.000 --> 23:14.460
The Trial Ground is now open.

24:01.540 --> 24:03.860
[Day One, Bloody Trial Ground]

24:10.110 --> 24:11.010
Where am I?

24:13.790 --> 24:14.460
I should hide...

24:14.470 --> 24:15.210
- Help! - ...and observe the situation.

24:15.730 --> 24:16.720
Help!

24:23.000 --> 24:24.330
Skyfort Castle disciples?

24:25.440 --> 24:26.420
Clear Void Sect!

24:26.680 --> 24:27.730
Fellow disciples?

24:28.400 --> 24:29.220
Senior Li!

24:29.310 --> 24:29.940
Senior Ren!

24:30.240 --> 24:31.010
Over here!

24:32.030 --> 24:32.460
Quickly!

24:32.560 --> 24:33.330
Let's get out of here!

24:34.270 --> 24:36.180
Any Yellow Maple Valley disciples?

24:39.640 --> 24:40.010
Qiaoqian,

24:40.440 --> 24:41.250
time is tight.

24:41.480 --> 24:42.180
We should get going.

24:46.550 --> 24:46.980
Let's go.

24:51.920 --> 24:52.770
I can't let them find out

24:53.310 --> 24:54.490
the secret of the Green Vial.

24:55.310 --> 24:56.860
I should act alone from here on.

25:11.550 --> 25:12.090
Senior Xiang.

25:33.680 --> 25:35.570
Let the hunt begin!

25:54.510 --> 25:56.250
The spiritual aura has indeed become thinner.

26:04.270 --> 26:04.860
Grandmaster.

26:07.640 --> 26:09.940
The Spirit Fusion Talisman actually worked.

26:10.350 --> 26:12.570
This talisman links the spiritual aura of its users.

26:12.960 --> 26:14.330
Even though the teleportation is random,

26:14.550 --> 26:15.570
there's at least a 50% chance

26:15.960 --> 26:17.050
we would land near each other.

26:19.310 --> 26:20.220
We landed here of all places.

26:20.750 --> 26:22.090
The odds are in our favor.

26:59.200 --> 26:59.660
I was right.

27:00.400 --> 27:01.620
The closer you get to the outer edge of the Trial Ground,

27:02.310 --> 27:03.250
the younger the spirit herbs.

27:04.440 --> 27:04.940
This means

27:05.350 --> 27:06.730
fewer rivals for me.

27:08.030 --> 27:09.330
I'll gather some seedlings and seeds,

27:09.680 --> 27:10.620
then rely on the Green Vial

27:10.830 --> 27:11.570
to hasten their maturation.

27:33.240 --> 27:34.490
Pardon me.

27:45.400 --> 27:46.570
The Gilded Five-Petal Flame.

28:16.440 --> 28:17.570
Someone's already dead.

28:29.030 --> 28:29.700
I'll have to be careful

28:30.640 --> 28:31.330
not to end up like him.

28:40.720 --> 28:41.730
The northeast edge of Wulong Pool

28:42.310 --> 28:43.090
lies in a secluded corner,

28:43.790 --> 28:45.420
its terrain shaped around a deep pool plunging dozens of feet down.

28:46.510 --> 28:47.570
According to the map,

28:48.590 --> 28:49.330
the Violet Monkey Blossom

28:49.750 --> 28:50.900
should grow somewhere near here.

28:59.350 --> 29:00.380
The miasma is dense here.

29:05.220 --> 29:08.140
[Miasma Purifying Veil]

29:18.480 --> 29:19.330
Coldwisp Herbs.

29:20.160 --> 29:21.620
They're valuable ingredients for concocting poisons.

29:27.920 --> 29:29.090
Who's there?

29:41.720 --> 29:42.380
Show yourself.

29:44.510 --> 29:45.380
You've already been exposed.

29:48.110 --> 29:49.490
Did my Stealth Talisman fail?

30:09.030 --> 30:09.660
Come out!

30:10.270 --> 30:11.290
I saw you lot!

30:12.750 --> 30:14.050
What a bluff.

30:20.070 --> 30:21.330
My precious.

30:30.110 --> 30:31.290
Frost Toads.

30:38.160 --> 30:38.620
Senior Yu,

30:39.240 --> 30:40.620
your Beast Taming Powder is incredible.

30:41.310 --> 30:42.090
Just a small bottle

30:42.240 --> 30:43.620
and the Frost Toads became completely obedient.

30:44.350 --> 30:46.010
Another elite of the Seven Sects taken down.

30:46.680 --> 30:47.490
These little creatures

30:47.680 --> 30:48.530
have certainly earned their keep.

30:49.590 --> 30:50.860
Frost Toads are docile by nature.

30:51.550 --> 30:52.940
They almost never attack

30:53.680 --> 30:55.050
unless provoked.

31:00.030 --> 31:00.490
Qi,

31:01.200 --> 31:02.140
collect the Coldwisp Herbs.

31:03.750 --> 31:04.460
There's no need

31:04.640 --> 31:05.660
to risk my life for some herbs.

31:06.480 --> 31:07.290
I'll let them have it.

31:09.400 --> 31:10.180
My goodness.

31:10.720 --> 31:11.570
I didn't expect

31:11.920 --> 31:13.290
to find you guys here.

31:21.000 --> 31:21.530
Keep your guard up.

31:22.270 --> 31:23.140
There could be an ambush.

31:28.960 --> 31:30.290
He was cautious,

31:31.000 --> 31:32.460
yet he still lost his life so easily.

31:33.480 --> 31:34.250
Those two

31:34.680 --> 31:35.900
came here to kill.

31:36.550 --> 31:37.420
What exactly are they after?

31:38.750 --> 31:39.810
Why won't they leave?

31:41.030 --> 31:41.460
Forget it.

31:41.960 --> 31:42.490
If they won't go...

31:42.510 --> 31:43.140
- The Coldwisp Herbs - ...I will.

31:43.240 --> 31:43.860
may be highly poisonous,

31:44.480 --> 31:45.860
but they're surprisingly beautiful.

31:46.200 --> 31:46.810
Indeed.

31:48.720 --> 31:49.940
Let's take his mystic pouch too.

31:50.400 --> 31:50.770
All right.

31:54.350 --> 31:54.940
Strange.

31:55.510 --> 31:56.380
It was just here.

32:00.270 --> 32:00.730
Is there

32:01.160 --> 32:01.900
someone else lurking nearby?

32:11.640 --> 32:12.620
I didn't find any spirit herbs,

32:13.400 --> 32:14.660
but I did get several mystic pouches.

32:16.350 --> 32:17.420
Now where should I go?

32:23.350 --> 32:24.810
I don't see any Violet Monkey Blossoms here.

32:25.510 --> 32:26.810
Seems the map the sect provided

32:27.270 --> 32:28.330
isn't entirely reliable.

32:33.160 --> 32:33.730
Senior Xiang,

32:33.880 --> 32:35.050
the path is slippery. Go slow.

32:41.720 --> 32:44.010
I've simply been here more times

32:44.070 --> 32:45.180
and know the way.

32:45.830 --> 32:47.420
I'll be counting on you

32:47.590 --> 32:48.730
talented young cultivators

32:48.880 --> 32:50.090
if we encounter spirit beasts.

32:50.400 --> 32:51.290
Leave it to us.

32:51.720 --> 32:53.660
This Trial Ground is practically a death labyrinth.

32:54.000 --> 32:55.380
Knowing the lay of the land is half the battle.

32:55.830 --> 32:57.940
You're the old steed who knows the way.

32:58.550 --> 32:59.810
With the three of us united,

33:00.240 --> 33:00.770
success is all

33:00.880 --> 33:02.330
but guaranteed.

33:02.920 --> 33:03.980
Why is he traveling

33:04.310 --> 33:06.220
with disciples from another sect?

33:07.440 --> 33:08.250
Han,

33:08.830 --> 33:09.900
I didn't expect

33:10.240 --> 33:12.050
to run into you here.

33:20.880 --> 33:21.810
Han.

33:31.830 --> 33:32.770
What do you say?

33:34.750 --> 33:36.570
Care to join us?

33:37.790 --> 33:40.420
We can look out for one another.

33:45.240 --> 33:46.220
You may not

33:46.440 --> 33:47.380
know this,

33:48.550 --> 33:50.770
but each sect's map

33:51.750 --> 33:53.940
for the Bloody Trial Ground

33:54.510 --> 33:55.420
marks different priorities.

33:55.750 --> 33:56.460
That's why

33:56.830 --> 33:58.490
sharing information

33:58.750 --> 33:59.940
and cooperating

34:00.440 --> 34:01.730
with other sects

34:02.030 --> 34:02.570
is

34:02.960 --> 34:04.180
the smart move.

34:09.350 --> 34:10.420
Thank you for your kind offer.

34:11.480 --> 34:12.460
But I'm weak

34:12.920 --> 34:14.090
and this is my first time in the Trial Ground.

34:15.070 --> 34:16.900
I only plan to gather some spirit herbs to complete my task.

34:17.830 --> 34:18.620
I wouldn't want to burden the three of you.

34:21.030 --> 34:21.570
No worries.

34:22.680 --> 34:23.140
No worries.

34:24.270 --> 34:25.570
Still,

34:25.880 --> 34:27.940
you didn't have to be so hasty to refuse us.

34:30.960 --> 34:31.730
Or

34:32.000 --> 34:32.900
are you perhaps

34:33.200 --> 34:33.860
after

34:34.000 --> 34:35.700
something important?

34:37.510 --> 34:39.090
If this guy doesn't know what's good

34:39.720 --> 34:40.380
for him,

34:40.510 --> 34:41.860
you shouldn't waste your breath on him.

34:42.240 --> 34:43.570
That's right, Xiang.

34:43.960 --> 34:45.380
Let him fend for himself.

34:49.830 --> 34:50.250
I shall leave now.

34:50.790 --> 34:51.250
Please excuse me.

34:51.590 --> 34:52.090
Farewell.

34:53.350 --> 34:53.980
No choice.

34:54.400 --> 34:55.420
I'll head in another direction.

34:58.550 --> 35:00.010
It's as if Senior Xiang has turned into a completely different person

35:00.720 --> 35:02.090
once we entered the Trial Ground.

35:33.590 --> 35:34.140
Hey, gambling addict.

35:36.920 --> 35:37.290
I'm talking to you!

35:45.800 --> 35:46.980
Why didn't you answer?

35:48.320 --> 35:48.820
What do you want?

35:50.360 --> 35:51.090
How about

35:51.630 --> 35:52.300
we place a bet?

35:53.110 --> 35:53.860
What bet?

35:54.070 --> 35:54.420
No bets.

35:55.400 --> 35:56.260
This trial will shape

35:57.110 --> 35:58.860
the future of the Seven Great Sects

35:59.320 --> 36:00.010
for the next 60,

36:00.110 --> 36:01.530
maybe even 100 years,

36:01.760 --> 36:02.210
no?

36:03.920 --> 36:04.690
I'm right, aren't I?

36:05.150 --> 36:05.530
So,

36:05.760 --> 36:06.460
let's bet

36:06.510 --> 36:08.050
on which sect gathers the most spirit herbs.

36:08.230 --> 36:08.530
Whoever collects the most wins.

36:08.710 --> 36:09.050
How about that?

36:09.070 --> 36:10.010
All right.

36:11.150 --> 36:12.340
But your rules aren't foolproof.

36:12.920 --> 36:13.860
What if it's a tie?

36:14.670 --> 36:15.010
Then what?

36:15.190 --> 36:16.010
Good point.

36:17.110 --> 36:17.980
Let me think...

36:18.800 --> 36:19.420
How about this?

36:19.710 --> 36:20.380
We bet

36:20.710 --> 36:21.690
on whether the number of disciples

36:21.840 --> 36:23.130
who make it out alive is odd or even.

36:23.400 --> 36:24.210
Shoo.

36:24.320 --> 36:24.780
Leave me alone.

36:27.440 --> 36:28.650
Han, you in?

36:29.000 --> 36:30.300
I'm not betting with you.

36:31.550 --> 36:32.570
He's no fun.

36:32.670 --> 36:33.050
Sheesh.

36:34.670 --> 36:35.610
Come on.

36:40.360 --> 36:41.090
Here's my offer.

36:41.670 --> 36:42.170
I'll wager

36:42.360 --> 36:43.050
two

36:43.360 --> 36:45.380
Bloodvein Drake Core Pills

36:45.760 --> 36:47.380
against your two pieces of iron concentrate.

36:49.070 --> 36:50.050
That's a fair deal, right?

36:52.960 --> 36:53.900
Bloodvein Drake Core Pills?

36:57.760 --> 36:58.210
What do you say?

36:59.550 --> 37:00.170
Fine.

37:00.440 --> 37:00.940
Two pieces it is.

37:06.510 --> 37:07.650
We're only betting on spirit herbs, nothing else.

37:09.000 --> 37:10.340
Whoever gathers the most wins.

37:13.070 --> 37:13.380
Go back.

37:16.150 --> 37:16.980
The bet's on.

37:34.360 --> 37:35.170
That guy's dead.

37:36.670 --> 37:38.050
That guy's dead too.

37:57.230 --> 37:58.050
It's only day one,

37:58.920 --> 38:00.130
yet their murderous intent has already been unleashed.

38:37.480 --> 38:38.380
Invisible

38:39.070 --> 38:39.690
and razor-sharp.

38:41.360 --> 38:43.300
A perfect weapon for ambushes indeed.

39:09.630 --> 39:10.380
Who goes there?

39:23.510 --> 39:24.900
It's that young man from Tainan Bazaar.

39:25.320 --> 39:26.420
Should we capture him and interrogate him?

39:28.480 --> 39:29.940
I had to suppress my cultivation to the Qi Refining Stage

39:29.960 --> 39:31.210
just to enter the Trial Ground.

39:32.190 --> 39:33.460
I'm already in a troublesome position.

39:34.670 --> 39:35.780
Let's focus on the mission.

39:36.190 --> 39:37.170
We don't want to invite more trouble.

39:38.110 --> 39:38.980
We should regroup

39:39.230 --> 39:40.380
with our other disciples first.

39:42.800 --> 39:43.570
Give these disciples a proper burial.

39:44.000 --> 39:44.780
- Yes, Grandmaster. - Yes.

39:54.550 --> 39:55.050
This should be

39:56.000 --> 39:57.340
a safe spot.

40:05.510 --> 40:06.530
The first day is already over,

40:07.760 --> 40:08.860
but I still haven't found what I came here for.

40:11.070 --> 40:12.340
To all disciples of the Seven Sects,

40:13.030 --> 40:15.570
congratulations on surviving the first daylight cycle.

40:16.440 --> 40:18.210
Remember, the night in the Bloody Trial Ground

40:18.400 --> 40:19.860
is far deadlier than the day.

40:21.070 --> 40:23.050
Death may come from the skies above.

40:23.800 --> 40:24.780
It'd be wise

40:25.230 --> 40:26.900
to find a safe place to hide.

40:37.360 --> 40:38.300
Senior Xiang

40:38.920 --> 40:40.380
knows this Trial Ground well,

40:41.030 --> 40:42.820
yet he still hasn't reached the Foundation Stage after three attempts.

40:43.840 --> 40:44.940
I can't share his fate.

40:45.630 --> 40:46.460
I never want

40:47.000 --> 40:48.260
to set foot in this place again.

41:15.480 --> 41:17.210
This rain chills me to the bone.

41:17.360 --> 41:18.490
There's something cursed about it.

41:19.000 --> 41:20.050
I have to circulate my energy to dispel the cold.

41:58.920 --> 42:00.210
It's only the first day

42:00.710 --> 42:02.490
and already so many have fallen.

42:03.840 --> 42:05.490
Seems this year's competition is fiercer

42:06.030 --> 42:07.780
than we anticipated.

42:12.540 --> 42:16.740
[Day Two, Bloody Trial Ground]

42:31.630 --> 42:32.980
The Soul-Burning Spell is reacting.

43:00.630 --> 43:01.340
Don't kill me!

43:02.000 --> 43:02.690
Don't kill me!

43:03.320 --> 43:04.490
Senior, save me!

43:05.880 --> 43:06.690
This is quite a predicament.

43:06.920 --> 43:08.050
Senior!

43:08.760 --> 43:09.530
Help won't come.

43:29.380 --> 43:34.700
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

43:35.940 --> 43:41.340
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

43:41.460 --> 43:44.660
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

43:44.900 --> 43:47.140
♪Old scenes rise again♪

43:47.540 --> 43:50.380
♪Too hard to forget♪

43:50.900 --> 43:54.860
♪Easier just to miss♪

43:55.700 --> 44:01.180
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

44:02.340 --> 44:07.620
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

44:08.220 --> 44:11.260
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

44:11.540 --> 44:13.660
♪Swept away by time♪

44:14.300 --> 44:16.940
♪Eyes once looked far♪

44:17.420 --> 44:21.380
♪Now lost in the shift♪

44:21.860 --> 44:24.700
♪Autumn winds stir♪

44:24.980 --> 44:26.900
♪Smoke curls once more♪

44:27.340 --> 44:29.780
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

44:30.100 --> 44:33.620
♪Returning to my eyes♪

44:34.180 --> 44:37.140
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

44:37.460 --> 44:40.380
♪Time lost its name♪

44:40.780 --> 44:43.620
♪Was it yesterday♪

44:44.020 --> 44:47.580
♪Or tomorrow?♪

44:47.940 --> 44:50.780
♪The world has changed♪

44:51.180 --> 44:53.020
♪Beyond recall♪

44:53.580 --> 44:55.300
♪Time will fade♪

44:55.700 --> 45:00.500
♪All the words ever spoken♪

45:01.180 --> 45:04.060
♪Only this longing remains♪

45:04.540 --> 45:09.820
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

45:10.940 --> 45:17.580
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

45:18.060 --> 45:27.780
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
